      "flexcontaineritem_2": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/flexcontaineritem",
       "title_1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "jcr:title": "High-performance camera modules and 3D sensing technologies designed for robotics, mobility, AR/VR, security, industrial automation, and next-generation AI-enabled devices.",
        "type": "h4",
        "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
       },
       "text_1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "text": "<p>NAMUGA is a global innovator in advanced camera modules and 3D sensing solutions, delivering ultra-compact, high-performance imaging technologies for some of the world’s most demanding applications. Founded in 2004 and headquartered in South Korea, NAMUGA combines advanced optics, sensing, AI-enabled imaging, and automated manufacturing expertise to help customers accelerate intelligent vision system development.</p>",
        "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
        "textIsRich": "true"
       }
      }
     }
    },
    "container_2": {
     "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
     "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
     "cq:styleIds": [
      "",
      "1717498052331",
      "1717498055877"
     ],
     "text_1": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "text": "<p>From stereo vision and Time-of-Flight sensing to compact RGB camera modules and solid-state LiDAR technologies, NAMUGA enables next-generation systems across robotics, mobility, security, AR/VR, medical, and industrial markets. Through Macnica, customers gain access not only to NAMUGA’s innovative technologies, but also the engineering expertise needed to integrate vision systems into complete edge AI and embedded solutions.</p>",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
     }
    }
   },
   "container_2": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
    "cq:styleIds": [
     "",
     "1717498056876"
    ],
    "container_1": {
     "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
     "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
     "cq:styleIds": [
      "",
      "1717498052331",
      "1717498055877"
     ],
     "title_1": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:title": "NAMUGA Vicon Lite",
      "type": "h2",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
     },
     "text_1": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "text": "<p>A vision-powered access control terminal with multi-modal 3D facial recognition, on-device AI authentication, and post-quantum encryption. Designed for secure facilities, enterprise buildings, and privacy-sensitive environments.</p>\n<p><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"/content/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/semiconductors/namuga-advanced-camera-and-3d-sensing-solutions-for-intelligent-systems/namuga-vicon-lite.html\" target=\"_self\">Learn more about the Vicon Lite platform</a>.</p>",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
     }
    },
    "container_2": {
     "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
     "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
     "cq:styleIds": [
      "",
      "1717498052331",
      "1717498055877"
     ],
     "title_1": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:title": "Why NAMUGA?",
      "type": "h2",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
     },
     "text_1": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "text": "<p>NAMUGA delivers advanced vision technologies engineered for real-world deployment. With expertise spanning optics, camera design, 3D sensing, calibration, and mass production manufacturing, NAMUGA supports customers from prototype through production scale.</p>\n<p><b>Key differentiators include:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Advanced 3D sensing technologies including Stereo Vision, Time-of-Flight (ToF), and LiDAR</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>Ultra-compact camera module design for space-constrained systems</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>AI-enabled imaging solutions optimized for edge intelligence</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>Expertise in robotics, mobility, AR/VR, security, and biomedical applications</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>High-volume automated manufacturing capabilities</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>Integrated optical, mechanical, and sensor engineering expertise</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>Advanced calibration and active alignment technologies</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>Proven support for global OEM and next-generation AI platforms</li>\n</ul>",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
     }
    }
   },
