        "1717498055877"
       ],
       "textwithimage_1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "fileReference": "/content/dam/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/semiconductors/namuga/images/amr-warehouse-shelves.jpg",
        "imageRatio": "36",
        "alt": "AMR shelving in warehouse",
        "text": "<p>NAMUGA develops advanced 3D sensing solutions that enable machines to understand and interact with the physical world. Leveraging Stereo Vision, Time-of-Flight (ToF), and solid-state LiDAR technologies, these solutions provide accurate depth perception for robotics, autonomous systems, industrial automation, and smart devices.</p>\n<p><b>Applications include:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Robotics and autonomous mobile robots (AMRs)</li>\n<li>Obstacle detection and navigation</li>\n<li>Gesture recognition</li>\n<li>Spatial mapping</li>\n<li>Smart access control and facial recognition</li>\n<li>Industrial automation and machine vision</li>\n</ul>",
        "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
        "isDecorative": "false",
        "textIsRich": "true",
        "altValueFromDAM": "false"
       }
      },
      "item_2": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "AR/VR",
       "cq:panelTitle": "AR/VR",
       "layout": "responsiveGrid",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
       "cq:styleIds": [
        "",
        "",
        "1717498055877"
       ],
       "textwithimage_1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "fileReference": "/content/dam/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/semiconductors/namuga/images/black-vr-ar-gui.jpg",
        "imageRatio": "36",
        "alt": "VR/AR headset and GUI",
        "text": "<p>NAMUGA provides advanced camera modules and sensing technologies optimized for augmented reality and virtual reality systems. Solutions include world-view cameras, eye-tracking cameras, gesture sensing, and compact 3D sensing modules designed for immersive and responsive user experiences.</p>\n<p><b>NAMUGA technologies support:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Eye tracking</li>\n<li>Hand tracking</li>\n<li>World-facing cameras</li>\n<li>Spatial awareness</li>\n<li>Mixed reality systems</li>\n<li>Lightweight and compact headset designs</li>\n</ul>",
        "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
        "isDecorative": "false",
        "textIsRich": "true",
        "altValueFromDAM": "false"
       }
      },
      "item_3": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "Mobility and Intelligent Transportation",
       "cq:panelTitle": "Mobility and Intelligent Transportation",
       "layout": "responsiveGrid",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
       "cq:styleIds": [
        "",
        "",
        "1717498055877"
       ],
       "textwithimage_1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "fileReference": "/content/dam/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/semiconductors/namuga/images/mobility-intelligent-sensing-cars.jpg",
        "imageRatio": "36",
        "alt": "Automotive radial sensing overlays",
        "text": "<p>NAMUGA develops advanced imaging and sensing solutions for automotive and mobility platforms, supporting next-generation driver assistance, autonomous navigation, and intelligent transportation systems.</p>\n<p><b>Solutions support:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>ADAS and autonomous driving</li>\n<li>Surround view systems</li>\n<li>Driver monitoring systems</li>\n<li>In-cabin sensing</li>\n<li>AI-powered transportation safety systems</li>\n<li>Smart mobility platforms</li>\n</ul>",
        "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
        "isDecorative": "false",
        "textIsRich": "true",
        "altValueFromDAM": "false"
       }
      },
      "item_4": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "Security and Smart Vision Systems",
       "cq:panelTitle": "Security and Smart Vision Systems",
       "layout": "responsiveGrid",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
       "cq:styleIds": [
        "",
        "",
        "1717498055877"
       ],
       "textwithimage_1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "fileReference": "/content/dam/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/semiconductors/namuga/images/black-mesh-model-grid.jpg",
        "imageRatio": "36",
        "alt": "Mesh mapping overlay on face",
        "text": "<p>NAMUGA’s intelligent imaging technologies enable advanced security and access control applications through AI-powered vision and multispectral sensing technologies. These systems are designed to improve authentication accuracy, situational awareness, and intelligent monitoring capabilities.</p>\n<p><b>Applications include:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Facial recognition</li>\n<li>Smart access systems</li>\n<li>AI-enabled surveillance</li>\n<li>Smart city infrastructure</li>\n<li>Intelligent security systems</li>\n<li>Secure authentication platforms</li>\n</ul>",
        "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
        "isDecorative": "false",
        "textIsRich": "true",
        "altValueFromDAM": "false"
       }
      }
     }
