      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/flexcontaineritem",
      "title_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "Engineered for Scale",
       "type": "h3",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
      },
      "text_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "text": "<p>NAMUGA combines advanced vision technology development with large-scale automated manufacturing capabilities. Its vertically integrated development model enables high-quality production while maintaining precision alignment, calibration, and reliability across complex imaging systems.</p>\n<p><b>Capabilities include:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Active alignment assembly</li>\n<li>Automated calibration and validation</li>\n<li>Optical module integration</li>\n<li>Compact package design</li>\n<li>Wafer-level optics</li>\n<li>Meta lens technologies</li>\n<li>High-volume automated production</li>\n</ul>",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
       "textIsRich": "true"
      }
     },
